\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お（わる）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">終わる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おわる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">结束</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">最終</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいしゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">最后；末班</span></li></ul></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"kcard\" data-id=\"n4:k:教\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">教</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>教</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おし（える）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">教育</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょういく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">教育</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">教える</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おしえる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">教；告诉</span></li></ul></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"kcard\" data-id=\"n4:k:室\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">室</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>室</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">—</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">教室</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうしつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">教室</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">会議室</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいぎしつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">会议室</span></li></ul></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"kcard\" data-id=\"n4:k:旅\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">旅</div><div class