/li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">真面目</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まじめ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">认真</span></li></ul></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"kcard\" data-id=\"n4:k:映\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">映</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>映</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うつ（る）</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">映画</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えいが</span><span class=\"k-wz\">电影</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">映る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うつる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">映出</span></li></ul></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"kcard\" data-id=\"n4:k:画\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">画</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>画</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ガ・カク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">—</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">計画</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいかく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">计划</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">画家</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">がか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">画家</span></li></ul></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"kcard\" data-id=\"n4:k:病\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">病</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>病</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ビョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やまい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">病気</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びょうき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">生病；疾病</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">病院</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びょういん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">医院</span></li></ul></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"kcard\" data-id=\"n4:k:院\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">院</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>院</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">—</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">入院</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にゅういん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">住院</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">退院</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいいん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">出院</span></li></ul></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">同</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>相同；一致；平等</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ドウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おな.じ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">同じ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おなじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">相同；一样；相等；相似；等同；无论如何；总之；如果一定要；既然</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">共同</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">合作；协作；联合；伙伴关系；一致行动；共同体；公共使用；共同拥有；共用</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">同一</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どういつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">相同；一致；同一；相等；平等；公平对待；无差别</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">自</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>自身；自己；自然；自发</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジ・シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みずか.ら・おの.ずから・おの.ずと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">自分</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じぶん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自己；自身；本人；我；本人；你；您</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">自転車</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じてんしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自行车；脚踏车</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">自動車</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じどうしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">汽车；轿车；机动车</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">発</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>发射；出发；揭发；发表；（枪炮）发</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハツ・ホツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">た.つ・あば.く・おこ.る・つか.わす・はな.つ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">出発</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅっぱつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">出发；离开；启程</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">発音</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はつおん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">发音；声音产生；发声</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">爆発</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばくはつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">爆炸；爆发；（情绪的）爆发；（愤怒的）爆发；（不满的）爆发</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">者</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>人；者</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シャ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もの</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">医者</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">医生；医师</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">歯医者</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">牙医；牙科医生</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">者</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もの</span><span class=\"k-wz\">人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">地</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>地面；大地；土地；地方；地基</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チ・ジ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">地図</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちず</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地图；地图册；图表；平面图</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">地下鉄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちかてつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地铁</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">地震</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地震</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">業</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>职业；技艺；事业；行为；行业</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ギョウ・ゴウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わざ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">授業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">课程；课堂；教学；授课；课业</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">工業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工业；制造业</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">産業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">产业；工业；生计；职业</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">方</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>方向；方法；人；方面；方形</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ホウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かた・-かた・-がた</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">方</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かた</span><span class=\"k-wz\">方向；方位；方面；人士；先生；女士；……的方法；……的方式；……的做法；由……转交；寄住在……处（用于地址）；负责人；主管；（……的）一方；……那边（如母亲那边）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">夕方</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうがた</span><span class=\"k-wz\">傍晚；黄昏（通常指下午三点至六点）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">仕方</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しかた</span><span class=\"k-wz\">方法；办法</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">新</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>新；新的</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あたら.しい・あら.た・あら-・にい-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">新聞</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんぶん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">报纸</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">新しい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あたらしい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">新的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">新聞社</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんぶんしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">报社；新闻社</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">場</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>场所；位置</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョウ・チョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ば</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">会場</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">集会场所；会议场地；活动场所；会场</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">工場</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">工厂；工场；车间；作坊</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">場合</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ばあい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">情况；场合；情形；状况</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">員</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>成员；员工；负责人；数量</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">店員</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てんいん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">店员；店铺员工；营业员；售货员</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">公務員</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうむいん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">公务员；政府雇员；公职人员；公共部门职员</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">委員</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いいん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">委员</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">立</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>站立；升起；建立；竖立</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リツ・リュウ・リットル</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">た.つ・-た.つ・た.ち-・た.てる・-た.てる・た.て-・たて-・-た.て・-だ.て・-だ.てる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">立つ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">站立；起立；站起来；竖起；站在（某处）；位于；坐落；处于（困境、领先等）；置身于；担任（职位、岗位）；处在某位置或状态；离开去（做某事）；出发；离开；启程；动身；扎进；刺入；穿透；形成；产生；出现；升起；吹起；流传；传播；众所周知；参选；竞选；参与选举；采取行动；行动；奋起；鼓起；勃起；变硬；确立；制定；形成；成立；有道理；站得住脚；合乎逻辑；合理；维持；维持生计；维持事业；保留；保持；得以保存；开始；来临；举办；进行；关闭；合上；关上；等于；是……的结果</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">立てる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たてる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">竖起；立起；树立；搭建；架设；刺入；戳入；埋入；挖入；发出；制造；引起；扬起；建立；制定；创建；拟定；形成；推举；提名；树立为领导；尊重；礼遇；给予应有地位；维护体面；磨快；使清晰；关闭；闭合；合上；点茶；进行茶道；除以；用力地…；尽力地…</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">役に立つ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やくにたつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">有用；有帮助；派得上用场</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">開</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../../n4/kanji/\">N4</a>打开；展开；开启；开封</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひら.く・ひら.き・-びら.き・ひら.ける・あ.く・あ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">開く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">打开；开启（如门等）；开张；开业（如商店等）；空着；闲置；空闲；有空；没人占用；敞开（如领口等）；（眼、嘴等）已睁开；张着；结束；终止；睁（眼）；张（嘴）；有洞；形成缝隙；间隔</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">開ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">打开（门等）；拆开（包裹等）；解锁；开门营业；开业；清空；腾出；留出空间；搬出；清空；离开（家等）；暂时外出；破晓；天亮；结束；终了；（新年）开始；新